#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:15
#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.desktop.in:5
msgid "Shrink images losslessly"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:17
msgid ""
"Image Optimizer makes PNG and JPEG files smaller without changing how they "
"look. It rewrites the files you pick in place, so the file you selected is "
"the one that gets smaller."
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:18
msgid ""
"The compression is lossless, which means the pixels come out identical and "
"nothing is re-encoded at a lower quality. What comes off is whatever the "
"encoder left on the table, so screenshots and interface images usually gain "
"the most and photos straight out of a camera the least."
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:19
msgid "Features:"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:21
msgid "Compress PNG and JPEG images without losing quality"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:22
msgid "Optimize a whole batch at once, several files at a time"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:23
msgid "Works offline, with no account and nothing uploaded"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:24
msgid "Keeps the colour profile, so wide-gamut images still look right"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:25
msgid "Keeps modification times, so a library sorted by date stays in order"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:26
msgid "Quit quickly by pressing Ctrl + Q"
msgstr ""

