msgid "What the whole batch saved, added up under the list"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:64
msgid "Optimizing a batch of images"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:68
msgid "Drag and drop images to get started"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:86
msgid ""
"A bar under the list now adds everything up: how much came off in total, how "
"many files were done and what percentage that is. While it is working it "
"shows how far along it is"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:87
msgid ""
"Files that cannot be optimized no longer disappear from the list. They stay, "
"with a line under the name saying why: not a PNG or JPEG, already as small "
"as it gets, or the reason it could not be written"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:88
msgid ""
"A file that was already as small as it gets is now told apart from one that "
"failed. Both used to look the same"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:89
msgid ""
"The window can be made much smaller, down to 460 by 320, and still shows "
"everything. It opens at the size it always did"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:90
msgid ""
"The list has been redrawn, with an icon in front of every row saying how it "
"went, numbers lined up under their headings, and larger type throughout"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:91
msgid ""
"The Flatpak version uses the graphics card again. It had been drawing every "
"frame and every letter on the processor"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:92
msgid ""
"Fixed rows lighting up when clicked and columns being draggable, in a list "
"where there is nothing to select or rearrange"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:93
msgid ""
"Fixed the button on the welcome screen taking on the system accent colour, "
"which put a red outline around it on some systems"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:100
msgid ""
"Image Optimizer no longer asks for access to your whole home folder. It is "
"handed only the images you pick, through the system file chooser, and "
"dragging images in keeps working the same way"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:101
msgid ""
"Images in a folder you have no permission to write to are now optimized as "
"well, where they used to be skipped"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:102
msgid ""
"Fixed an image that could not be rewritten being reported as optimized, with "
"a saving it never made"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:109
msgid ""
"Optimizing a folder full of images is several times faster, because they are "
"now handled at the same time instead of one after another"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:110
msgid "Images are compressed further than before, JPEGs in particular"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:111
msgid ""
"Colour profiles are now kept, so wide-gamut photos no longer shift colour "
"after optimizing"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:112
msgid ""
"Modification times are kept on JPEGs as well, so a photo library sorted by "
"date stays in order"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:113
msgid ""
"Fixed a batch stopping early when one file had a quote or a bracket in its "
"name"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:114
msgid "Fixed a crash when a selected file turned out not to be an image"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:115
msgid "Fixed the button for adding more images being invisible on some systems"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:116
msgid ""
"Bitmap files are no longer accepted, because they cannot be optimized in "
"place"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:117
msgid ""
"Image Optimizer is now available from the Snap Store, and takes up less room "
"once installed"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:124
msgid ""
"Image Optimizer has been rebuilt on GTK4, so it fits in with current "
"elementary OS releases"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:125
msgid "Browsing for images now opens the system file chooser"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:126
msgid "Drag and drop has been rebuilt for the new toolkit"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:127
msgid ""
"File sizes are now formatted the way the rest of your system formats them"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:128
msgid ""
"The image list no longer refreshes on a repeating timer, which lowers idle "
"processor use"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:129
msgid "Added a donation link for anyone who would like to support development"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:135
msgid "Fixed some warnings that happened under the hood."
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:140
msgid ""
"Fixed flatpak issue where dragging an image gives a 0 byte sized image and "
"would therefore not be optimized. Also fixed issue where optimizing an image "
"from the home directory would not work."
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:146
msgid "Updated flatpak runtime to version 6"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:147
msgid "Fixed issue where the close and maximise buttons were shown in white"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:148
msgid "Updated screenshots"
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:154
#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:159
msgid "Getting things ready for Elementary OS 6."
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.gijsgoudzwaard.image-optimizer.appdata.xml.in:164
msgid ""
"Added the flatpak manifest file for elementary os 6. Also fixes vala 0.48 "
"build issue."
msgstr ""

